## 🎨 Color Palette

### Monochromatic System

**CRITICAL RULE:** GHXSTSHIP uses ONLY black, white, and greyscale. No color under any circumstances.

#### Primary Colors

```css
--color-black: #000000;    /* Pure black */
--color-white: #FFFFFF;    /* Pure white */
```

**Usage:**
- **Black (#000000):** Primary backgrounds, bold text, graphic elements, maximum impact
- **White (#FFFFFF):** Primary backgrounds, contrast text, highlights, negative space

#### Greyscale Spectrum

```css
--grey-100: #F5F5F5;    /* Lightest grey - subtle backgrounds */
--grey-200: #E5E5E5;    /* Light grey - borders, dividers */
--grey-300: #D4D4D4;    /* Mid-light grey - secondary borders */
--grey-400: #A3A3A3;    /* Medium grey - secondary text */
--grey-500: #737373;    /* Mid grey - tertiary text */
--grey-600: #525252;    /* Mid-dark grey - metadata text */
--grey-700: #404040;    /* Dark grey - subtle backgrounds */
--grey-800: #262626;    /* Darker grey - near-black backgrounds */
--grey-900: #171717;    /* Almost black - deep backgrounds */
```

### Color Usage Guidelines

#### Backgrounds
```
Primary Sections: Alternate #000000 and #FFFFFF for maximum contrast
Subtle Sections: Use grey-100 (#F5F5F5) or grey-900 (#171717)
Cards/Containers: White on black pages, black on white pages
Hover States: Invert (black → white, white → black)
```

#### Text
```
Primary Text: #000000 on white backgrounds, #FFFFFF on black backgrounds
Secondary Text: grey-400 (#A3A3A3) for less important content
Metadata/Labels: grey-600 (#525252) for timestamps, tags, captions
Disabled States: grey-300 (#D4D4D4)
```

#### Borders & Dividers
```
Strong Borders: 2-3px solid black or white
Subtle Borders: 1px solid grey-200 (#E5E5E5)
Section Dividers: Thick horizontal rules in black or white
```

#### Interactive Elements
```
Default State: Black on white or white on black
Hover State: Invert colors (black ↔ white)
Focus State: 3px outline in contrasting color
Active State: Scale down + invert
Disabled State: grey-300 (#D4D4D4)
```

