### ANTON - Display & H1

**Purpose:** Maximum impact headlines, hero statements, brand signatures

**Characteristics:**
- Weight: Regular (400) - single weight only
- Style: Condensed, ultra-bold
- Transform: UPPERCASE preferred
- Best for: Hero headlines, page titles, major statements

**Size Scale:**
```css
/* Hero / Display */
font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 120px);
line-height: 1.0;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;

/* H1 / Page Title */
font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 80px);
line-height: 1.05;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;
```

**Usage Guidelines:**
- ✅ Use for company name, hero headlines, major impact statements
- ✅ Always uppercase for maximum visual impact
- ✅ Tight line-height (0.9-1.1) for density and power
- ✅ Negative letter-spacing (-0.02em to 0) for tighter composition
- ✅ Pure black or pure white only
- ❌ Never use for body copy or small text
- ❌ Never use in mixed case (always UPPERCASE)
- ❌ Never use at sizes below 36px

**Examples:**
```
GHXSTSHIP
WE CREATE WORLDS
THE IMPOSSIBLE IS OUR SPECIALTY
DESIGN. DEVELOP. DIRECT. DISRUPT.
```

**CSS Implementation:**
```css
.text-hero {
  font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 120px);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.text-h1 {
  font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 80px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 400;
}
```

