## ♿ Accessibility Standards

### Color Contrast

With black/white/greyscale palette, contrast is inherently strong:

```
Black (#000000) on White (#FFFFFF): 21:1 (AAA) ✅
White (#FFFFFF) on Black (#000000): 21:1 (AAA) ✅
Grey-600 (#525252) on White (#FFFFFF): 7.3:1 (AAA) ✅
Grey-400 (#A3A3A3) on Black (#000000): 4.8:1 (AA) ✅
```

### Focus States

```css
/* Visible focus indicator */
*:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--color-black);
  outline-offset: 4px;
}

/* Focus on dark backgrounds */
.dark *:focus-visible {
  outline-color: var(--color-white);
}

/* Never remove focus indicators */
❌ *:focus { outline: none; } /* NEVER DO THIS */
```

### Touch Targets

```css
/* Minimum 48x48px touch targets */
.btn, .link, .interactive {
  min-height: 48px;
  min-width: 48px;
  padding: 14px 20px; /* Ensures 48px+ height */
}
```

### Screen Reader Text

```css
/* Visually hidden but accessible to screen readers */
.sr-only {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border-width: 0;
}
```

