## 🎨 Design System Do's and Don'ts

### ✅ DO

**Color:**
- Use pure black (#000000) and pure white (#FFFFFF) for maximum impact
- Use greyscale tones for subtle hierarchy
- Alternate black and white backgrounds for section variety
- Invert colors on hover for interaction feedback

**Typography:**
- Use ANTON for massive impact headlines (always uppercase)
- Use Bebas Neue for all section headers and navigation
- Use Share Tech for all body copy and descriptions
- Use Share Tech Mono for metadata, dates, and technical labels
- Maintain proper hierarchy: larger = more important

**Layout:**
- Create bold, asymmetric compositions
- Use generous whitespace
- Emphasize geometric precision
- Create strong visual hierarchy through size contrast

**Images:**
- Convert ALL images to high-contrast B&W
- Apply halftone overlays for Pop Art effect
- Use duotone treatments for subtle variation

**Animation:**
- Use hard cuts and wipes, not soft fades
- Animate with purpose and intention
- Respect reduced-motion preferences
- Keep animations at 60fps

**Components:**
- Use thick borders (2-3px) for emphasis
- Create hard geometric shadows, not soft drop shadows
- Ensure 48x48px minimum touch targets
- Provide clear focus indicators

### ❌ DON'T

**Color:**
- ❌ Never use any color beyond black, white, and greyscale
- ❌ No gradients (except halftone patterns)
- ❌ No soft, subtle color transitions
- ❌ No pastel or muted tones

**Typography:**
- ❌ Never use ANTON for body copy or small text
- ❌ Don't use ANTON in mixed case (always UPPERCASE)
- ❌ Don't use Share Tech or Share Tech Mono for headlines
- ❌ Never use decorative or script fonts
- ❌ Don't make body text too small (<15px)

**Layout:**
- ❌ No organic, curved, or soft shapes
- ❌ No subtle, timid design elements
- ❌ Don't overcrowd - respect whitespace
- ❌ No centered-everything layouts (be dynamic)

**Images:**
- ❌ Never use color photographs
- ❌ No low-contrast or washed-out images
- ❌ Don't use stock photos without B&W treatment
- ❌ No soft, blurry, or out-of-focus imagery

**Animation:**
- ❌ No soft fade transitions
- ❌ No organic, bouncy, or elastic animations
- ❌ Don't animate just for decoration
- ❌ No animations that cause motion sickness

**Components:**
- ❌ No soft drop shadows
- ❌ No rounded corners (except strategic use)
- ❌ No subtle, barely-visible borders
- ❌ Don't remove focus indicators

